# VERBATIM SENSORS — byte-exact portal/server exports (SERVER_SETUP_DOCTRINE.md §6).
# These files are SHA256-verified against the OneDrive drop zone at landing. Git's EOL
# normalization would silently rewrite their bytes on checkout and break the verbatim claim,
# so text conversion is DISABLED for the export payloads. The doctrine .md is normal text.
config/*.json      -text
motd/*.md          -text
motd/*.txt         -text
snapshots/*.json   -text
